{
  "book": "mosiah",
  "bookName": "Mosiah",
  "chapter": 3,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 429.99,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.926,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And again my brethren, I would call your attention,",
      "verse": "3:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 3.106,
      "end": 5.66,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I have somewhat more to speak unto you;",
      "verse": "3:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 5.84,
      "end": 10.02,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, I have things to tell you concerning that which is to come.",
      "verse": "3:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 10.7,
      "end": 13.115,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the things which I shall tell you",
      "verse": "3:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 13.295,
      "end": 16.221,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "are made known unto me by an angel from God.",
      "verse": "3:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 16.401,
      "end": 17.841,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he said unto me:",
      "verse": "3:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 18.021,
      "end": 18.903,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Awake;",
      "verse": "3:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 19.083,
      "end": 20.337,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I awoke,",
      "verse": "3:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 20.517,
      "end": 22.375,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold he stood before me.",
      "verse": "3:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 23.055,
      "end": 24.495,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he said unto me:",
      "verse": "3:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 24.675,
      "end": 27.647,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Awake, and hear the words which I shall tell thee;",
      "verse": "3:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 27.827,
      "end": 32.378,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, I am come to declare unto you the glad tidings of great joy.",
      "verse": "3:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 33.058,
      "end": 35.473,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For the Lord hath heard thy prayers,",
      "verse": "3:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 35.653,
      "end": 38.114,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and hath judged of thy righteousness,",
      "verse": "3:4",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 38.294,
      "end": 41.777,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and hath sent me to declare unto thee that thou mayest rejoice;",
      "verse": "3:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 41.957,
      "end": 44.79,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that thou mayest declare unto thy people,",
      "verse": "3:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 44.97,
      "end": 47.431,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they may also be filled with joy.",
      "verse": "3:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 48.111,
      "end": 50.108,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, the time cometh,",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 50.288,
      "end": 51.96,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and is not far distant,",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 52.14,
      "end": 53.487,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that with power,",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 53.667,
      "end": 55.757,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Lord Omnipotent who reigneth,",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 55.937,
      "end": 59.931,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who was, and is from all eternity to all eternity,",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 60.111,
      "end": 63.455,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall come down from heaven among the children of men,",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 63.635,
      "end": 66.236,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and shall dwell in a tabernacle of clay,",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 66.416,
      "end": 68.413,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and shall go forth amongst men,",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 68.593,
      "end": 70.358,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "working mighty miracles,",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 70.538,
      "end": 72.396,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "such as healing the sick,",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 72.576,
      "end": 74.109,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "raising the dead,",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 74.289,
      "end": 76.147,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "causing the lame to walk,",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 76.327,
      "end": 78.417,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the blind to receive their sight,",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 78.597,
      "end": 80.362,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the deaf to hear,",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 80.542,
      "end": 82.539,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and curing all manner of diseases.",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 83.219,
      "end": 89.21,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he shall cast out devils, or the evil spirits which dwell in the hearts of the children of men.",
      "verse": "3:6",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 89.89,
      "end": 93.28,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And lo, he shall suffer temptations, and pain of body,",
      "verse": "3:7",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 93.46,
      "end": 95.689,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "hunger, thirst, and fatigue,",
      "verse": "3:7",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 95.869,
      "end": 98.098,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even more than man can suffer,",
      "verse": "3:7",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 98.278,
      "end": 99.857,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except it be unto death;",
      "verse": "3:7",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 100.037,
      "end": 102.916,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, blood cometh from every pore,",
      "verse": "3:7",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 103.096,
      "end": 105.975,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "so great shall be his anguish for the wickedness",
      "verse": "3:7",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 106.155,
      "end": 108.756,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the abominations of his people.",
      "verse": "3:7",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 109.436,
      "end": 111.758,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he shall be called Jesus Christ,",
      "verse": "3:8",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 111.938,
      "end": 113.285,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Son of God,",
      "verse": "3:8",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 113.465,
      "end": 115.508,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Father of heaven and earth,",
      "verse": "3:8",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 115.688,
      "end": 118.242,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Creator of all things from the beginning;",
      "verse": "3:8",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 118.422,
      "end": 120.698,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his mother shall be called Mary.",
      "verse": "3:8",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 121.378,
      "end": 123.746,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And lo, he cometh unto his own,",
      "verse": "3:9",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 123.926,
      "end": 126.991,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that salvation might come unto the children of men",
      "verse": "3:9",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 127.171,
      "end": 129.261,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even through faith on his name;",
      "verse": "3:9",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 129.441,
      "end": 131.252,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and even after all this",
      "verse": "3:9",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 131.432,
      "end": 133.429,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they shall consider him a man,",
      "verse": "3:9",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 133.609,
      "end": 135.559,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and say that he hath a devil,",
      "verse": "3:9",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 135.739,
      "end": 137.364,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and shall scourge him,",
      "verse": "3:9",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 137.544,
      "end": 139.169,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and shall crucify him.",
      "verse": "3:9",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 139.849,
      "end": 142.589,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he shall rise the third day from the dead;",
      "verse": "3:10",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 142.769,
      "end": 145.37,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold, he standeth to judge the world;",
      "verse": "3:10",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 145.55,
      "end": 148.151,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold, all these things are done",
      "verse": "3:10",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 148.331,
      "end": 152.046,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that a righteous judgment might come upon the children of men.",
      "verse": "3:10",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 152.726,
      "end": 155.327,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, and also his blood atoneth",
      "verse": "3:11",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 155.507,
      "end": 159.64,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the sins of those who have fallen by the transgression of Adam,",
      "verse": "3:11",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 159.82,
      "end": 163.767,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who have died not knowing the will of God concerning them,",
      "verse": "3:11",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 163.947,
      "end": 166.362,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or who have ignorantly sinned.",
      "verse": "3:11",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 167.042,
      "end": 168.946,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But wo, wo unto him",
      "verse": "3:12",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 169.126,
      "end": 171.82,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who knoweth that he rebelleth against God!",
      "verse": "3:12",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 172.0,
      "end": 174.368,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For salvation cometh to none such",
      "verse": "3:12",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 174.548,
      "end": 178.217,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except it be through repentance and faith on the Lord Jesus Christ.",
      "verse": "3:12",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 178.897,
      "end": 183.587,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the Lord God hath sent his holy prophets among all the children of men,",
      "verse": "3:13",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 183.767,
      "end": 187.807,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to declare these things to every kindred, nation, and tongue,",
      "verse": "3:13",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 187.987,
      "end": 191.516,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thereby whosoever should believe that Christ should come,",
      "verse": "3:13",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 191.696,
      "end": 194.529,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the same might receive remission of their sins,",
      "verse": "3:13",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 194.709,
      "end": 197.077,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and rejoice with exceedingly great joy,",
      "verse": "3:13",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 197.257,
      "end": 200.136,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even as though he had already come among them.",
      "verse": "3:13",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 200.816,
      "end": 204.485,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yet the Lord God saw that his people were a stiffnecked people,",
      "verse": "3:14",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 204.665,
      "end": 207.033,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he appointed unto them a law,",
      "verse": "3:14",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 207.213,
      "end": 208.606,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even the law of Moses.",
      "verse": "3:14",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 209.286,
      "end": 211.469,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And many signs, and wonders,",
      "verse": "3:15",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 211.649,
      "end": 213.507,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and types, and shadows",
      "verse": "3:15",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 213.687,
      "end": 215.312,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "showed he unto them,",
      "verse": "3:15",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 215.492,
      "end": 217.025,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "concerning his coming;",
      "verse": "3:15",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 217.205,
      "end": 221.292,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also holy prophets spake unto them concerning his coming;",
      "verse": "3:15",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 221.472,
      "end": 223.515,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and yet they hardened their hearts,",
      "verse": "3:15",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 223.695,
      "end": 228.153,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and understood not that the law of Moses availeth nothing",
      "verse": "3:15",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 228.333,
      "end": 231.723,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except it were through the atonement of his blood.",
      "verse": "3:15",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 232.403,
      "end": 236.165,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And even if it were possible that little children could sin",
      "verse": "3:16",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 236.345,
      "end": 238.017,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they could not be saved;",
      "verse": "3:16",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 238.197,
      "end": 240.426,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but I say unto you they are blessed;",
      "verse": "3:16",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 240.606,
      "end": 244.739,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, as in Adam, or by nature, they fall,",
      "verse": "3:16",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 244.919,
      "end": 247.659,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even so the blood of Christ atoneth for their sins.",
      "verse": "3:16",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 248.339,
      "end": 252.286,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And moreover, I say unto you, that there shall be no other name given",
      "verse": "3:17",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 252.466,
      "end": 254.416,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nor any other way nor means",
      "verse": "3:17",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 254.596,
      "end": 257.986,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whereby salvation can come unto the children of men,",
      "verse": "3:17",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 258.166,
      "end": 260.581,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "only in and through the name of Christ,",
      "verse": "3:17",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 260.761,
      "end": 262.386,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Lord Omnipotent.",
      "verse": "3:17",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 263.066,
      "end": 264.738,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold he judgeth,",
      "verse": "3:18",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 264.918,
      "end": 266.543,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his judgment is just;",
      "verse": "3:18",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 266.723,
      "end": 270.067,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the infant perisheth not that dieth in his infancy;",
      "verse": "3:18",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 270.247,
      "end": 273.08,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but men drink damnation to their own souls",
      "verse": "3:18",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 273.26,
      "end": 275.071,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except they humble themselves",
      "verse": "3:18",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 275.251,
      "end": 277.434,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and become as little children,",
      "verse": "3:18",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 277.614,
      "end": 284.441,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and believe that salvation was, and is, and is to come, in and through the atoning blood of Christ,",
      "verse": "3:18",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 284.621,
      "end": 286.246,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Lord Omnipotent.",
      "verse": "3:18",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 286.926,
      "end": 289.666,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For the natural man is an enemy to God,",
      "verse": "3:19",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 289.846,
      "end": 292.214,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and has been from the fall of Adam,",
      "verse": "3:19",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 292.394,
      "end": 294.902,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and will be, forever and ever,",
      "verse": "3:19",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 295.082,
      "end": 298.24,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "unless he yields to the enticings of the Holy Spirit,",
      "verse": "3:19",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 298.42,
      "end": 304.132,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and putteth off the natural man and becometh a saint through the atonement of Christ the Lord,",
      "verse": "3:19",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 304.312,
      "end": 306.262,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and becometh as a child,",
      "verse": "3:19",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 306.442,
      "end": 310.018,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "submissive, meek, humble, patient, full of love,",
      "verse": "3:19",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 310.198,
      "end": 315.446,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "willing to submit to all things which the Lord seeth fit to inflict upon him,",
      "verse": "3:19",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 315.626,
      "end": 318.32,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even as a child doth submit to his father.",
      "verse": "3:19",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 319.0,
      "end": 322.158,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And moreover, I say unto you, that the time shall come",
      "verse": "3:20",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 322.338,
      "end": 329.443,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when the knowledge of a Savior shall spread throughout every nation, kindred, tongue, and people.",
      "verse": "3:20",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 330.123,
      "end": 332.584,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, when that time cometh,",
      "verse": "3:21",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 332.764,
      "end": 335.411,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "none shall be found blameless before God,",
      "verse": "3:21",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 335.591,
      "end": 337.774,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except it be little children,",
      "verse": "3:21",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 337.954,
      "end": 342.18,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "only through repentance and faith on the name of the Lord God Omnipotent.",
      "verse": "3:21",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 342.86,
      "end": 344.532,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And even at this time,",
      "verse": "3:22",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 344.712,
      "end": 347.359,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when thou shalt have taught thy people the things",
      "verse": "3:22",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 347.539,
      "end": 350.14,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which the Lord thy God hath commanded thee,",
      "verse": "3:22",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 350.32,
      "end": 353.896,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even then are they found no more blameless in the sight of God,",
      "verse": "3:22",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 354.076,
      "end": 357.373,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "only according to the words which I have spoken unto thee.",
      "verse": "3:22",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 358.053,
      "end": 362.047,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I have spoken the words which the Lord God hath commanded me.",
      "verse": "3:23",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 362.727,
      "end": 364.445,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus saith the Lord:",
      "verse": "3:24",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 364.625,
      "end": 369.641,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "They shall stand as a bright testimony against this people, at the judgment day;",
      "verse": "3:24",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 369.821,
      "end": 374.001,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whereof they shall be judged, every man according to his works,",
      "verse": "3:24",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 374.181,
      "end": 377.292,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whether they be good, or whether they be evil.",
      "verse": "3:24",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 377.972,
      "end": 379.412,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And if they be evil",
      "verse": "3:25",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 379.592,
      "end": 385.165,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they are consigned to an awful view of their own guilt and abominations,",
      "verse": "3:25",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 385.345,
      "end": 393.379,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which doth cause them to shrink from the presence of the Lord into a state of misery and endless torment,",
      "verse": "3:25",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 393.559,
      "end": 395.835,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "from whence they can no more return;",
      "verse": "3:25",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 396.015,
      "end": 399.08,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they have drunk damnation to their own souls.",
      "verse": "3:25",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 399.76,
      "end": 403.615,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, they have drunk out of the cup of the wrath of God,",
      "verse": "3:26",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 403.795,
      "end": 406.767,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which justice could no more deny unto them",
      "verse": "3:26",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 406.947,
      "end": 412.473,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "than it could deny that Adam should fall because of his partaking of the forbidden fruit;",
      "verse": "3:26",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 412.653,
      "end": 416.322,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, mercy could have claim on them no more forever.",
      "verse": "3:26",
      "lineIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "start": 417.002,
      "end": 420.485,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And their torment is as a lake of fire and brimstone,",
      "verse": "3:27",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 420.665,
      "end": 422.987,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whose flames are unquenchable,",
      "verse": "3:27",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 423.167,
      "end": 426.278,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and whose smoke ascendeth up forever and ever.",
      "verse": "3:27",
      "lineIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "start": 426.458,
      "end": 428.316,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thus hath the Lord commanded me.",
      "verse": "3:27",
      "lineIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "start": 428.496,
      "end": 429.332,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Amen.",
      "verse": "3:27",
      "lineIndex": 143
    }
  ]
}